{"seq":3,"slug":"telemetry-pipeline-incident-response","title":"采集断链、丢数据与遥测平台应急实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/observability-tracing-telemetry-platform/observability-platform-governance/telemetry-pipeline-incident-response","wordCount":2494,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"采集断链-丢数据与遥测平台应急实操\">采集断链、丢数据与遥测平台应急实操</h1><p>跨境电商平台最危险的可观测性故障，不是后端崩了直接报错，而是<strong>后端没崩、图表照画，而数据其实已经悄悄少了一半</strong>。大促当天 20:14，履约服务的 P99 延迟曲线从 340ms 跳到 1.8s，值班同学打开 tracing 想看慢在哪一跳，却发现最新的 trace 停在 20:11——采样器、投递管道、还是存储写入出了问题？如果这三者无法在几分钟内区分，你会在「以为有数据」的状态下做决策，这正是遥测平台事故区别于普通线上事故的地方：<strong>被观测系统还活着，观测系统先瞎了</strong>。本文把「数据丢了」拆成可定位、可量化、可演练的一条链路，给出告警、剧本与治理闭环的具体做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-丢数据的四种形态\">核心概念：丢数据的四种形态</h2><p>「丢了」是一个笼统的说法，实际操作中必须先把丢失点归类，因为每一类的检测信号和修复动作完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong>第一类是应用侧丢弃。</strong> SDK 的 batch span processor 队列满、导出超时，会静默丢弃本地缓冲的 span。这一层丢了，你在 Collector 的接收计数上<strong>什么都看不到</strong>——因为数据根本没到达管道。</p>\n<p><strong>第二类是传输侧拒绝。</strong> 应用发出的 OTLP 请求被 Collector 的 receiver 拒绝，典型原因是 <code>memory_limiter</code> 触发保护或 receiver 并发上限被打满。检测信号是 <code>otelcol_receiver_refused_spans</code>（及对应的 <code>_metric_points</code>、<code>_log_records</code>）持续为正——官方文档明确指出，该速率持续上升意味着「客户端正在丢失数据」。（来源：<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/collector/internal-telemetry/\">OpenTelemetry Collector Internal Telemetry</a>）</p>\n<p><strong>第三类是管道侧队列溢出。</strong> 数据在 Collector 内被接收、处理，但卡在 exporter 前的发送队列。官方韧性文档描述的策略是明确的：<strong>队列一旦满，新来的数据被丢弃，以免 Collector OOM</strong>——即 drop，而非 block。内存队列默认 <code>sending_queue.queue_size</code> 为 <code>1000</code> 批，重试默认 <code>max_elapsed_time</code> 为 300s；超过重试窗口仍未成功的最旧数据会被丢弃。检测信号是 <code>otelcol_exporter_enqueue_failed_*</code>，以及日志里的固定串 <code>&quot;Dropping data because sending_queue is full&quot;</code>。（来源：<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/collector/resiliency/\">OpenTelemetry Collector Resiliency</a>）</p>\n<p><strong>第四类是后端写入失败。</strong> 数据成功发给了后端，但后端因索引压力、磁盘水位或鉴权问题拒绝落盘。此时 <code>otelcol_exporter_send_failed_*</code> 上升；要区分「可重试的暂时失败」与「最终丢弃」，需结合队列深度是否回到 0 判断——<strong>send_failed 不等于已丢失，它仍可能重试成功</strong>，这是最容易误判的一类。</p>\n<p>四类的核心区别可用注册表里的可用性约束统一表达。设应用产生速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>（span/s），管道导出能力为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>，则队列长度近似满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q(t) \\approx \\max\\left(0,\\; Q(0) + (\\lambda - \\mu)\\,t\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda &gt; \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 持续超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{cap}/(\\lambda-\\mu)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的时间，溢出必然发生。这条式子给出的运维直觉是：<strong>队列容量只买时间，不解决根因</strong>——它把「何时开始丢」推迟到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{cap}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 填满之后。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-collector-自监控指标把丢失点钉死\">用 Collector 自监控指标把丢失点钉死</h2><p>定位断链的唯一可靠工具是 Collector 自身暴露的内部遥测，默认以 Prometheus 格式暴露在 <code>http://127.0.0.1:8888/metrics</code>，通过 <code>service::telemetry::metrics::level</code> 控制详细度（<code>none</code>/<code>basic</code>/<code>normal</code> 默认/<code>detailed</code>）。注意 <code>metrics::address</code> 在 v0.123.0 后已被忽略，端口配置改走 readers。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标名</th>\n<th>所在层</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>判定动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans</code></td>\n<td>receiver</td>\n<td>被接收的 span 数</td>\n<td>与上游产生速率比对，缺口即应用侧丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_receiver_refused_spans</code></td>\n<td>receiver</td>\n<td>被拒绝的 span 数</td>\n<td>&gt;0 持续 → 降采样/扩容/放宽 limiter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_processor_incoming_items</code> / <code>outgoing_items</code></td>\n<td>processor</td>\n<td>处理器进出量</td>\n<td>两者差额大 → 处理器丢弃或过滤条件误伤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_exporter_enqueue_failed_spans</code></td>\n<td>exporter 队列</td>\n<td>入队失败（队列满）</td>\n<td>最典型的「管道内丢数据」信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_exporter_sent_spans</code></td>\n<td>exporter</td>\n<td>成功发出</td>\n<td>与 accepted 比对算端到端完整率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_exporter_send_failed_spans</code></td>\n<td>exporter</td>\n<td>发送失败（可能重试成功）</td>\n<td>需配合队列深度判最终丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_exporter_queue_size</code> / <code>queue_capacity</code></td>\n<td>exporter 队列</td>\n<td>当前/额定队列深度</td>\n<td>两者比值逼近 1 → 即将溢出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>otelcol_exporter_in_flight_requests</code></td>\n<td>exporter</td>\n<td>在途请求（含退避重试）</td>\n<td>长期高 → 后端慢或网络抖动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>端到端采集完整率</strong>可由这组指标直接算出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Completeness</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>accepted</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>sent</mtext><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>generated</mtext><mtext>app</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Completeness} = 1 - \\frac{\\Delta\\,\\text{accepted} - \\Delta\\,\\text{sent}_{ok}}{\\Delta\\,\\text{generated}_{\\text{app}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Completeness</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4377em;vertical-align:-1.0662em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">generated</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">app</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">accepted</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sent</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0662em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>generated</mtext><mtext>app</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{generated}_{\\text{app}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0747em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">generated</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">app</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须由应用侧自报（例如自定义 counter），否则你只能算管道内部的相对损耗，无法发现第一类「根本没到 Collector」的丢失。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[应用 SDK&lt;br/&gt;batch 队列] --&gt;|丢①本地溢出| X1[静默丢弃]&#10;  A --&gt;|OTLP| R[receiver]&#10;  R --&gt;|refused_spans| X2[拒绝:limiter/并发]&#10;  R --&gt; P[processor 链]&#10;  P --&gt;|incoming vs outgoing| X3[处理器丢弃]&#10;  P --&gt; Q[exporter 发送队列]&#10;  Q --&gt;|enqueue_failed| X4[队列满丢弃]&#10;  Q --&gt; E[exporter 重试]&#10;  E --&gt;|send_failed 超 max_elapsed_time| X5[重试耗尽丢弃]&#10;  E --&gt; B[后端存储]&#10;  B --&gt;|写入拒绝| X6[落盘失败]\">flowchart TD\n  A[应用 SDK&lt;br/&gt;batch 队列] --&gt;|丢①本地溢出| X1[静默丢弃]\n  A --&gt;|OTLP| R[receiver]\n  R --&gt;|refused_spans| X2[拒绝:limiter/并发]\n  R --&gt; P[processor 链]\n  P --&gt;|incoming vs outgoing| X3[处理器丢弃]\n  P --&gt; Q[exporter 发送队列]\n  Q --&gt;|enqueue_failed| X4[队列满丢弃]\n  Q --&gt; E[exporter 重试]\n  E --&gt;|send_failed 超 max_elapsed_time| X5[重试耗尽丢弃]\n  E --&gt; B[后端存储]\n  B --&gt;|写入拒绝| X6[落盘失败]</pre><p>图上每个 <code>X</code> 都对应上表里一个可采集信号——<strong>没有信号覆盖的丢失点就是不可观测的丢失点</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把-没数据-本身变成可告警的事件\">把「没数据」本身变成可告警的事件</h2><p>普通告警范式是「指标越界则报警」，但遥测平台最危险的故障是<strong>指标消失</strong>——此时所有基于该指标的告警都不会触发，形成沉默失败。Prometheus 的 <code>absent()</code> 正是为此设计：当选择器匹配不到任何时间序列时，它返回值为 1 的单样本；文档给出的示例是 <code>absent(nonexistent{job=&quot;myjob&quot;})</code> 返回 <code>{job=&quot;myjob&quot;}</code>。据此可写出「数据源消失」告警：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- alert: TraceIngestSilent&#10;  expr: absent(otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans{service_instance_id=&quot;gw-01&quot;})&#10;  for: 3m\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TraceIngestSilent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">absent(otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans{service_instance_id=\"gw-01\"})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3m</span></span></code></pre></div><p>（函数语义来源：<a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/querying/functions/\">Prometheus Querying Functions — absent()</a>）</p>\n<p>仅有 <code>absent()</code> 还不够，因为它只能发现「已知实例消失」，无法发现「告警管道本身断了」。业界用**心跳/死亡开关（dead man&#39;s switch）**补上这一层：一条恒真向量（如 <code>vector(1)</code>）组成的 ALERTS 序列定期推送到外部接收器，只要接收器在约定周期内没收到，就说明整条告警链路（采集→规则→Alertmanager→通知）已失效。Google SRE Workbook 在讨论低流量服务告警时也强调同一思路的另一面——真实用户信号稀薄时需用合成探测主动产生信号，但要警惕「合成请求成功、真实用户失败」掩盖真实信号的风险（来源：<a href=\"https://sre.google/workbook/alerting-on-slos/\">Google SRE Workbook — Alerting on SLOs</a>）。</p>\n<p>守则：<strong>遥测平台必须先观测自己</strong>，至少要有三条独立维度的守卫告警——实例存活（<code>absent</code>）、队列健康（<code>queue_size/queue_capacity &gt; 0.8</code> 持续 5 分钟）、落盘成功率（<code>sent/(sent+failed)</code> 低于阈值）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采集断链应急剧本-从告警到恢复\">采集断链应急剧本：从告警到恢复</h2><p>事故一旦确认，恢复优先级不是「让图变好看」，而是<strong>先止损丢数据、再恢复可见性、最后查根因</strong>。下面是一份可直接演练的分级剧本。</p>\n<p><strong>T+0～5 分钟｜确认范围。</strong> 第一动作是判定「全量丢」还是「部分丢」：看是单个 Gateway 实例还是整层。若只有个别实例，通常是该实例的队列或后端连接问题；若整层一致，多半是后端或网络。同时用 <code>health_check</code> 扩展（Beta）探针确认 Collector 进程是否还可服务，用 <code>zpages</code>（端口 <code>55679</code>，TraceZ 页 <code>/debug/tracez</code>）查看实时 span 流与卡住的位置——官方故障排查文档提醒，zPages 可能包含 Collector 自身不输出的错误日志，是现场最快的探针。（来源：<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/collector/troubleshooting/\">OpenTelemetry Collector Troubleshooting</a>）</p>\n<p><strong>T+5～15 分钟｜止血。</strong> 按丢失形态分流：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>应用侧丢：临时提高 SDK 导出并发或切换为阻塞式导出。</li>\n<li>receiver 拒绝：放宽 <code>memory_limiter</code> 上限、扩容 Collector 副本，或对非关键信号降采样（参考同 hub 的<a href=\"../tracing-instrumentation-propagation/sampling-strategy-engineering\">采样策略工程</a>）。</li>\n<li>队列溢出：最常见的一种，<strong>根因通常是后端出口慢</strong>。短期可加大 <code>queue_size</code>、启用磁盘 WAL（<code>file_storage</code> 扩展 + <code>sending_queue.storage</code>），把内存队列换成可跨重启恢复的持久队列；但持久队列只是把丢失从「内存溢出」推迟到「磁盘写满或重试耗尽」，仍需治本。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>T+15 分钟起｜恢复可见性。</strong> 用 <code>debug</code> exporter（<code>verbosity: detailed</code>）在单实例上采样落盘，确认数据格式与字段完整；用 <code>otelcol components</code> 核对当前二进制是否真的启用了预期组件——配置写了但发行版不含该组件，是「数据莫名消失」的经典误配。</p>\n<p><strong>收尾｜记录丢失区间。</strong> 应急必须产出一个明确的「数据可信区间」：从何时到何时的 trace/metric 不完整，供后续所有基于该区间的分析标注。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结-把丢失量化成-slo-并闭环\">小结：把丢失量化成 SLO 并闭环</h2><p>事故复盘不能停在「重启后恢复」。遥测平台本身也要有 SLO，核心 SLI 是<strong>采集完整率</strong>与<strong>可见性中断时长</strong>。建议把「端到端完整率 ≥ 99.9%」和「单次可见性中断 ≤ 15 分钟」写成服务目标，并用前文公式自动计算误差预算消耗。</p>\n<p>治理上要做三件闭环动作：<strong>其一，为每个丢失点补一个检测信号</strong>——凡是流程图里存在丢弃分支却无对应指标或日志的管道，都登记为待补项；<strong>其二，把容量关系写进容量规划</strong>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{cap}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 显式估算大促峰值下的可容忍中断时长，而不是拍脑袋设 <code>queue_size</code>；<strong>其三，定期演练</strong>——杀掉 Gateway、注入后端 5xx、填满磁盘 WAL，验证告警是否在预期时间内触发、剧本是否可执行。</p>\n<p>跨境与金融场景还有外部约束叠加。欧盟《数字运营韧性法案》（DORA，Digital Operational Resilience Act）自 <strong>2025 年 1 月 17 日</strong>起适用，要求金融实体向主管当局报告<strong>重大 ICT 相关事件</strong>；事件分类与重大性阈值由 <strong>(EU) 2024/1772</strong> 号授权条例规定，报告的时间限制与标准表格由配套 RTS/ITS 确定。对覆盖跨境支付的观测平台而言，<strong>「能不能证明某段时间的数据是完整的」直接关系到事件报告的证据链是否成立</strong>——这让「采集完整率」从内部运维指标升级为合规证据。（来源：<a href=\"https://www.digital-operational-resilience-act.com/\">DORA 官方信息页</a>）</p>\n<p>最后回到本文开头那个 20:14 的场景：能在三分钟内区分「应用丢、接收拒、队列满、后端拒」四者的人，靠的不是经验，而是<strong>一条已建好的自监控指标链 + 一份演练过的剧本</strong>。存储与查询层如何承载这些数据的量与成本，见同 hub 的<a href=\"../telemetry-pipeline-storage-cost/telemetry-storage-query-engine\">遥测存储与查询引擎</a>；而这条管道本身的组件与拓扑，见<a href=\"../telemetry-pipeline-storage-cost/collector-pipeline-architecture\">Collector 管道架构</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"采集断链、丢数据与遥测平台应急实操","id":"采集断链-丢数据与遥测平台应急实操"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：丢数据的四种形态","id":"核心概念-丢数据的四种形态"},{"level":2,"text":"用 Collector 自监控指标把丢失点钉死","id":"用-collector-自监控指标把丢失点钉死"},{"level":2,"text":"把「没数据」本身变成可告警的事件","id":"把-没数据-本身变成可告警的事件"},{"level":2,"text":"采集断链应急剧本：从告警到恢复","id":"采集断链应急剧本-从告警到恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"小结：把丢失量化成 SLO 并闭环","id":"小结-把丢失量化成-slo-并闭环"}],"prev":{"title":"可观测性平台的自监控与 SLO 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/observability-tracing-telemetry-platform/observability-platform-governance/platform-self-observability-slo"},"next":null}